showcabling doesn't take any arguments
remove 192.168 from examples, replace with 172.
ifconfig eth up
ip addr del IP/24 dev eth
ip addr add IP/24 dev eth
also can modify /etc/systemd/network/eth1.network  to make it stick
ip route del IP/24
ip route add IP/24 via gw (gw must be IP of the peer)
make sure that /sbin is in user's path
change topo to this:
NWworkstation1 1.1.1.1
NWrouter 1.1.1.2 2.2.2.1
ISrouter 2.2.2.2 3.3.3.1
SWrouter 3.3.3.2 4.4.4.1
SWworkstation 4.4.4.2